From e3b871500e056be3f28224586edc935e6cfb1e7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 09:39:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add buyer-interest tracking, vendor outreach emails, and
 dashboard charts

Vendor profile and dashboard now surface how many buyers have shown interest
(vendor_recommendations + buyer_vendor_selections), let vendors email an
interested buyer directly from that buyer's detail page (logged via a new
vendor_outreach_events table + record-vendor-outreach edge function, with
mailto: handoff since no transactional email provider is configured), show a
"Contacted" badge on the buyers list, and chart interest-over-time next to a
new outreach-sent stat. Buyers now also see a notification when a vendor
reaches out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BZibWYPysw75xiFQpbHszf
